#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Web Remote"
msgstr "Webafstandsbediening"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Turn on to control this player from a phone or tablet on the same network. "
"HTTP is not encrypted: use only a trusted private network. Scan the QR code "
"with the phone's camera to open the remote."
msgstr ""
"Schakel in om deze speler te bedienen vanaf een telefoon of tablet op "
"hetzelfde netwerk. HTTP is niet versleuteld: gebruik het alleen op een "
"vertrouwd privénetwerk. Scan de QR-code met de camera van de telefoon om de "
"afstandsbediening te openen."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Enable web remote"
msgstr "Webafstandsbediening inschakelen"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "QR-code"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Web remote is off."
msgstr "De webafstandsbediening is uitgeschakeld."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "KDE Connect / GSConnect"
msgstr "KDE Connect / GSConnect"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"If you have KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) or GSConnect (GNOME) installed, "
"your paired phone already shows media controls, track information and volume "
"for this player - no extra setup is required on our side."
msgstr ""
"Als KDE Connect (Plasma, Android) of GSConnect (GNOME) is geïnstalleerd, "
"toont je gekoppelde telefoon al mediabediening, nummerinformatie en volume "
"voor deze speler – aan onze kant is geen extra instelling nodig."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Install KDE Connect on your phone"
msgstr "KDE Connect op je telefoon installeren"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Open the link on the phone's app store. Pair once - then media keys, "
"notifications and file sharing work both ways."
msgstr ""
"Open de link in de appwinkel van de telefoon. Eén keer koppelen – daarna "
"werken mediatoetsen, meldingen en bestanden delen in beide richtingen."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Open KDE Connect download page"
msgstr "Downloadpagina van KDE Connect openen"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "No local network found. Connect to a network and try again."
msgstr ""
"Geen lokaal netwerk gevonden. Maak verbinding met een netwerk en probeer het "
"opnieuw."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Scan the code with the phone's camera."
msgstr "Scan de code met de camera van de telefoon."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Web remote stopped: {error}"
msgstr "Webafstandsbediening gestopt: {error}"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Could not start server"
msgstr "Kon de server niet starten"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgctxt "BCP 47 language tag of this translation"
msgid "en"
msgstr "nl"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Remote control"
msgstr "Afstandsbediening"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Media"
msgstr "Media"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Playback progress"
msgstr "Voortgang van het afspelen"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Verbinden…"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Connected to your computer"
msgstr "Verbonden met je computer"

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid "Disconnected. Check the network and keep the player open."
msgstr "Verbinding verbroken. Controleer het netwerk en houd de speler open."

#: crates/ui/media/big-player-ui/src/smartphone/dialog.rs
msgid ""
"Use only on a trusted local network. This HTTP connection is not encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Alleen gebruiken op een vertrouwd lokaal netwerk. Deze HTTP-verbinding is "
"niet versleuteld."

